KiroCrew
--------
kiro-claude can fetch, build and run KiroCrew (https://github.com/kirodotdev/KiroCrew),
referenced unmodified as the git submodule vendor/KiroCrew at commit
665a0e4e4a6507de0f3e7cffd3160c9359900c7c (kirocrew 0.13.0). KiroCrew is
Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates and is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0; see vendor/KiroCrew/LICENSE, vendor/KiroCrew/NOTICE and
vendor/KiroCrew/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES. kiro-claude does not include KiroCrew in its
npm package.

`kiro-claude crew setup` installs @agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp
(Apache License 2.0) from npm for Kiro Crew's Bot sessions.
